###############################################################################
# FIBO alignment annotations (annotation only — FIBO is never imported).
# Term IRIs below follow the https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/
# pattern; exact module paths are best-effort for the MVP and MUST be
# verified against the current FIBO 2.0 release before production use.
# See docs/fibo-alignment.md for the human-readable mapping table.
###############################################################################

bc:Deposit
